From cb85fc3689af4e95f624b63fe9241d7abdf16ece Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 15:15:54 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] Regression: references for fnpf breaking 01-03, new cases
 fnpf_2d_break_kennedy / _romero

- re-blessed (fnpf breaking 01-03 change them): fnpf_3d_amr_break, _adapt,
  _adapt_sub, _sub, _kennedy, _romero, fnpf_3d_amr_coast_wd_adapt, _sub,
  _sub_place. A/B of all 82 fnpf_* cases, 39c45955 with and without 01-03:
  71 identical, these 9 different, fnpf_3d_amr_coast_wd(_mpi2) close; without
  01-03 all 82 pass the stored references
- fnpf_2d_break_kennedy: A 350 2 on steep deep-water 5th-order Stokes waves,
  A 355 0.25 (2D deep-water flag, viscosity spreading)
- fnpf_2d_break_romero: the same with A 350 3
---
